OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FThousands of jobs will be saved after
OL,7,Fconfirmation today (18th August) of a
OL,8,Fpartnership between the government and
OL,9,Fthe West Midlands Combined Authority
OL,10,F(WMCA), to take local control of bus
OL,11,Fservices.
OL,13,FThe WMCA will keep routes running
OL,14,Fafter approving the acquisition of
OL,15,FNational Express' West Midlands bus
OL,16,Foperations.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FMobico Group, parent company of
OL,7,FNational Express, confirmed its
OL,8,Fintention to reduce risk to its bus
OL,9,Foperations as the West Midlands region
OL,10,Fmoves towards bus franchising.
OL,12,FNational Express is the biggest bus
OL,13,Foperator in the region, accounting for
OL,14,Faround 94% of bus journeys in the West
OL,15,FMidlands.
OL,17,FIts regional operation includes around
OL,18,F4,800 staff, 1,300 buses and nine
OL,19,Fdepots.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FBuses account for around 80% of all
OL,7,Fpublic transport journeys in the West
OL,8,FMidlands, carrying around 4.6 million
OL,9,Ftrips each week.
OL,11,FWMCA has now approved a managed
OL,12,Facquisition to protect passengers,
OL,13,Fstaff, services, depots, fleet and the
OL,14,Fwider bus network.
OL,16,F"We stepped in"
OL,18,FRichard Parker, Mayor of the West
OL,19,FMidlands, said:
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,F"I wasn't prepared to stand by and
OL,7,Fwatch hundreds of buses disappear from
OL,8,Four roads because a private company
OL,9,Fdecided to walk away.
OL,11,F"People rely on these buses to get to
OL,12,Fwork, to school or to hospital
OL,13,Fappointments. They are a public
OL,14,Fservice and I believe they should be
OL,15,Frun in the public interest.
OL,17,F"So we stepped in. We protected the
OL,18,Fservices people depend on, protected
OL,19,Fjobs and kept the West Midlands moving.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,F"For too long, decisions about our
OL,7,Fbuses have been driven by what works
OL,8,Fcommercially, rather than what
OL,9,Fpassengers and communities need. That
OL,10,Fis what has to change, and I am
OL,11,Fchanging it.
OL,13,F"I won't shy away from taking
OL,14,Fdifficult decisions in the public
OL,15,Finterest. We are continuing to push
OL,16,Fahead with franchising because I want
OL,17,Fdecisions about routes, fares and
OL,18,Ftimetables made here in the West
OL,19,FMidlands, with passengers put first.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,F"There should be no doubt who our bus
OL,7,Fnetwork ultimately answers to - the
OL,8,Fmillions of people who rely on it
OL,9,Fevery single day."
OL,11,FHow will the deal impact buses?
OL,13,FIt will mean greater control over
OL,14,Froutes, timetables, fares and service
OL,15,Fstandards creating a more reliable,
OL,16,Fjoined up and accountable bus network
OL,17,Ffor local communities.
OL,19,FWhen will this happen?
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@RO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FThe Combined Authority expects the
OL,7,Facquisition to complete in the autumn,
OL,8,Fsubject to final due diligence checks.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Bus Limited, the company
OL,11,Festablished to hold the bus
OL,12,Foperations, will then operate as an
OL,13,Farm's length subsidiary of WMCA, with
OL,14,Fits own governance and operational
OL,15,Fmanagement.
OL,17,FWill those employed by National
OL,18,FExpress be affected?
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FPension arrangements for staff are
OL,7,Funaffected by the transaction, and the
OL,8,Fpackage has been designed to protect
OL,9,Fservices, maintain network stability
OL,10,Fand support the transition to
OL,11,Ffranchising.
OL,13,FThe financial package will be funded
OL,14,Fmainly by WMCA through existing
OL,15,Ftransport investment plans, with
OL,16,F#11.5m of Government support for
OL,17,Ftransaction-related costs.
OL,19,FWill bus services be affected?
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FServices, tickets and timetables will
OL,7,Fcontinue as normal during the legal
OL,8,Fand operational handover. Passengers
OL,9,Fdo not need to do anything
OL,10,Fdifferently, the WMCA expects services
OL,11,Fto continue as normal once the
OL,12,Fhandover is complete.
OL,14,FIn the meantime, West Midlands Bus
OL,15,FLimited will operate during the
OL,16,Ftransition to maintain continuity and
OL,17,Fstability while the new model is put
OL,18,Fin place.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
