PN,34110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1787077108
OL,3,CWest Midlands buses set to be
OL,4,Cnationalised
OL,6,FFurther updates will be provided to
OL,7,Fpassengers, staff and stakeholders as
OL,8,Fthe acquisition progresses.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/10
